expect Your move
clean
shot backgammon-save-kept
# The computer hit a checker. Black holds the 6 entry point, so double 6s
# cannot come in, and the turn passes without a tap.
tap Roll
expect You rolled double 6s and cannot move.
expect Bar · White 2
tap Roll
expect You rolled double 6s and cannot move.
tap Roll
expect You rolled double 3s. Only one move is legal. Tap Bar to bring a checker in.
tap Roll
expect The dice are already rolled. 3, 3, 3 and 3 left to play.
tap-id point-5
expect A checker on the bar has to come in first. Tap Bar.
tap Bar
expect Tap a marked point to bring the checker in.
clean
shot backgammon-bar-entry
tap Bar
expect Checker put back on the bar.
tap Bar
tap-id point-21
expect 3, 3 and 3 left to play.
tap Bar
tap-id point-21
expect-missing Bar · White
tap-id point-23
tap-id point-20
tap-id point-10
